{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:30 2026-09-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:19 2026-09-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:19 2026-09-09 HKT</p><p>西貢發生行山客遇蜂螫意外。今日（9日）下午1時54分，兩名男子連同其他同伴一行11人行山，他們今(9日)早上10時30半由西貢猴塘溪出發，至中午1時許，一行人行到白沙澳近老虎岩時，懷疑有人不小心撞到一個蜂巢，其中姓劉（34歲）及姓陳(26歲)男子被蜂螫傷分別頭部及四肢，同伴於是報警，警方及救護人員到場，兩名事主清醒被送往將軍澳醫院治理。</p><img alt=\"遭蜂螫傷的男子由救護車送院。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b3a7b6b4cd26a8315cf4c731fe7fe85/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_15_24_39.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45b61b8d43759ec31ed7eb3afe860261/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_15_24_41_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a38be96a14d64064b35b2528692ce950/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_15_24_40_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"遭蜂螫傷的男子由救護車送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a3cfe55b497e881667a444bd931169a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_15_24_40_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者清醒由救護車送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c61fe0a26b2c8e34be53df8077a13df/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_15_24_40_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"同行者陪同傷者送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56067c8e755a29f0cef76e6794f7f3fe/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_15_24_41.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7ef8168b605f53412c0828babc14dce/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_15_24_40.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e716eac5a15e9b7b920aa55336faf6a6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_15_24_41_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T08:40:39.805096+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}